      "text": "[6:36AM] #LagAbkExpWay\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nIt's another Sunday morning and traffic is good as expected along the Lagos Abeokuta Express way , taking it from Tollgate through Ajegunle, Alakuko down to Abule Egba.\nThe return journey back to Tollgate is also a seamless traffic movement.\n\nAbule Egba underneath the bridge through Charity junction en route Agege is free as expected, same as the return journey.\n\nDrive carefully!\n#FollowLASTMA\n@TrafficChiefNG \n@lagostraffic961 \n@trafficpalava",
